      "message": "fix(examples): regenerate the first 4-axis part project under stamp v3\n\nPR #2135 saved examples/first-4axis-part.camproj on a branch without\nPR #2155, which moved the operation stamp salt to camcraft-op-stamp-v3.\nOn main each cached operation of the example read stale, the machine\ncheck refused it, and the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program\nfailed. Regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1: the five stamps and the file\nversion (62 -> 63) change; the cached moves and the posted program\nexamples/first-4axis-part.nc are byte-identical.\n\nFixes #2198\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
